You have an account on https://git.runv.club with the same username
and SSH key as here. Only members can see anything on it.

The first password is in ~/.forgejo-password. Log in on the web, pick a
new one, then you can delete that file.

Make a repository on the web, then push to it over SSH on port 2222:

  git remote add origin ssh://git@git.runv.club:2222/you/project.git
  git push -u origin main

Each account gets 1G of space on git. There is no CI here.
